Sheffield ya iku salah sijining &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; lan distrik metropolitan ing South Yorkshire, &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; lan minagka mung siji &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; ing South Yorkshire. Jembaré ya iku 367,94 &lt;a href="km%C2%B2"&gt;km²&lt;/a&gt; lan penduduké cacahé 520.700 wong (2005).
Sheffield mbentang ing tengah akehé bukit. Pusat &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; ya iku ing ngendi Kali Sheaf ketemu Kali Don. &lt;a href="Kutha"&gt;Kutha&lt;/a&gt; iki ana ing étan &lt;a href="Peak%20District%20National%20Park"&gt;Peak District National Park&lt;/a&gt;.
Sheffield kaloka amarga indhustri piranti mangané (kaya ta ladhing lan &lt;a href="sendok"&gt;sendok&lt;/a&gt;). Wong-wong Sheffield wés gawé piranti-piranti mangan wiwit &lt;a href="abad%20angka%2016"&gt;abad angka 16&lt;/a&gt;.
Sheffield uga kaloka amarga indhustri baja. &lt;a href="Benjamin%20Huntsman"&gt;Benjamin Huntsman&lt;/a&gt; nemu tèhnik peleburan logam kanggo gawé baja ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1740"&gt;1740&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Taun"&gt;Taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1856"&gt;1856&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Henry%20Bessemer"&gt;Henry Bessemer&lt;/a&gt; nemu tungku geni saka baja &lt;a href="Konverter%20Bessemer"&gt;Konverter Bessemer&lt;/a&gt;. Henry pindhah ing Sheffield kanggo gawé baja. Salalnjuté, ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1912"&gt;1912&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Harry%20Brearly"&gt;Harry Brearly&lt;/a&gt; nemu baja sing ora neyeng ing Sheffield.
Klub &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; kapisaan ing &lt;a href="donya"&gt;donya&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="Sheffield%20United"&gt;Sheffield United F.C.&lt;/a&gt;. Sheffield United F.C. kadhapur ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1857"&gt;1857&lt;/a&gt;. Klub bal-balan kasebut manggon ing stadhioné kang jenengé &lt;a href="Brammal%20Lane"&gt;Brammal Lané&lt;/a&gt;.
Akeh band kaloka saka Sheffield. Ing antarané Pulp, Human League, The Long Blondes, Thee Sheffield Phonographic Corporation lan Def Leppard. Aktor lan komedian Michael Palin uga asalé saka Sheffield.
