Hattusa

Hattusa (URUḪa-at-tu-ša 𒌷𒄩𒀜𒌅𒊭; Ḫattuša, cedhak &lt;a href="Bo%C4%9Fazkale"&gt;Boğazkale&lt;/a&gt; (sadurungé Boğazköy), &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku kutha krajan &lt;a href="bangsa%20Hittite"&gt;bangsa Hittite&lt;/a&gt; ning &lt;a href="Zaman%20Perunggu"&gt;Zaman Perunggu&lt;/a&gt; pungkasan. Hattusa dilebokke sajeroning dhaftar &lt;a href="Situs%20Warisan%20Donya%20UNESCO"&gt;Situs Warisan Donya UNESCO&lt;/a&gt; ning taun 1986.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
