Rupert Grint

<h2>Rupert Grint</h2>
Rupert Grint.
Rupert Alexander Lloyd Grint (#ALIH) ya iku aktor saka &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; kang main ana ing seri filem &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter"&gt;Harry Potter&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="Ron%20Weasley"&gt;Ron Weasley&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Grint lair ing &lt;a href="Watton-at-Stone"&gt;Watton-at-Stone&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hertfordshire"&gt;Hertfordshire&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké barep saka 5 sadulur. Bapaké, Nigel Grint, ya iku wong dagang &lt;a href="memorabilia"&gt;memorabilia&lt;/a&gt;, dan ibuné, Jo (Parsons)ya iku mung ibu rumah tangga. Dhèwèké duwé adhi lanang ya iku, James, lan 3 adhi wadon ya iku Georgina, Samantha, lan Charlotte. Sadurungé éntuk paraga ing filem Harry Potter, lan mung mèlu kanggo peran ing pertujnukan sekolah lan kelompok teater lokal Top Hat Stage School. Nalika cilik, dhèwèké tau maragakaké iwak ing pertunjukan dhedhasar carita &lt;a href="Bahtera%20Nuh"&gt;Bahtera Nuh&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Dhèwèké fans buku Harry Potter mula Grint ngupaya supaya éntuk paraga ing filem &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter"&gt;Harry Potter&lt;/a&gt;. Kanggo audisi iki, dhèwèké ngirim video dhèwèké. Sawisé ngebarké filem sepisané ya iku &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter%20and%20The%20Sorcerer%27s%20Stone"&gt;Harry Potter and The Sorcerer's Stone&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké maragakaé ing filem &lt;a href="lawak"&gt;lawak&lt;/a&gt; Inggris, dia berperan &lt;a href="Thunderpants"&gt;Thunderpants&lt;/a&gt; minangka Alan A. Allen (&lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;). Ing taun 2002, 2004, 2005, lan 2007, dhèwèké mbalik maragakaké Ron Weasley ing sekuel Harry Potter, &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter%20and%20the%20Chamber%20of%20Secrets%20%28filem%29"&gt;Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter%20and%20the%20Prisoner%20of%20Azkaban%20%28filem%29"&gt;Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter%20and%20the%20Goblet%20of%20Fire%20%28filem%29"&gt;Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter%20and%20the%20Order%20of%20the%20Phoenix%20%28filem%29"&gt;Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix&lt;/a&gt;
Grint uga maragakaké ing carita remaja &lt;a href="Driving%20Lessons"&gt;Driving Lessons&lt;/a&gt; bareng &lt;a href="Laura%20Linney"&gt;Laura Linney&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Julie%20Walters"&gt;Julie Walters&lt;/a&gt; (kang maragakaké Mrs. Weasley ing filem Harry Potter), kang wis dirilis ing mangsa panas 2006.
Dhèwèké uga dikenal nalika ngisi suara radio lan telivisi, dhèwèké minangka &lt;a href="Nigel%20Molesworth"&gt;Nigel Molesworth&lt;/a&gt; ing serial &lt;a href="Baggy%20Trousers"&gt;Baggy Trousers&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="BBC%20Radio%204"&gt;BBC Radio 4&lt;/a&gt; and voiced &lt;a href="Peter%20Pan"&gt;Peter Pan&lt;/a&gt; in a &lt;a href="BBC"&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt; documentary. Ing &lt;a href="9%20Juli"&gt;9 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, Grint lan kancané, &lt;a href="Daniel%20Radcliffe"&gt;Daniel Radcliffe&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Emma%20Watson"&gt;Emma Watson&lt;/a&gt; nggawé cethakan tangan, sikil, lan tongkat sikir ing ngaret &lt;a href="Grauman%27s%20Chinese%20Theater"&gt;Grauman's Chinese Theater&lt;/a&gt; ing Hollywood.
